---
title: Proposed Forge asset pipeline - cook and publish
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Author
    participant C as Cook command
    participant V as Asset tools
    participant D as Cooked output
    Note over A,D: Proposed build sequence
    A->>C: Cook authored sources
    C->>V: Validate recipes and chunks
    V-->>C: Source and dependency results
    alt Rejected
        C-->>A: Report invalid data or asset ID
    else Valid
        C->>C: Plan rebuild from changed inputs
        C->>V: Export affected assets
        V-->>C: Cooked bytes and dependencies
        C->>C: Hash outputs and build manifest
        C->>D: Publish loose files and manifest
        D-->>A: Active build
    end
    Note over A,D: CI checks clean and incremental outputs match.
